  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened capacity of member States to ratify and apply international labour standards and to fulfil their reporting obligations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO aims to continue its efforts to align law and practice in Qatar with international labour standards through the continuation of the technical cooperation programme with the Ministry of Labour, where all interventions will be guided by the relevant international labour standards. Support will be provided, where necessary, for fulfilling reporting requirements on the application of the conventions. In addition, further efforts will be made to promote the ratification of additional international labour standards, especially C155 &amp; C187, and C190.</narrative>
  </description>
